00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:05.230 align:start position:0%
 
[Applause]  they haven't eaten anything for days  this is a protest against the end of  Dhaka all of them arrived as small  children in the US this is Monica  Camacho she crossed the Mexican border  with her mother when she was seven years  old she was the first one in her family  to learn English all of them finished  high school and our University now as  they protested outside the capital  politicians like Representative Nancy  Pelosi or Senator Cory Booker encouraged  them the dreamers goal is to find a  long-term solution for them and for  their parents who are also undocumented  only those who entered the country when  they were younger than 16 and after 2007  are eligible for the daca program  Monica's dad was the first one to come  to the United States with a people  smuggler  two years later mother and daughter  followed the same dangerous path through  the desert from Mexico to Arizona I was  mad  but now that I'm older I understand why  he did it and and if I was in his shoes  I've done the same thing for my family  Monica said her battle is much smaller  than the one her parents had to fight my  dreamers are my parents my dad because  he you know he wanted to give us a  better life  he wanted us to have better  opportunities than what he had when he  was younger he only went to school for  six months all we want to do is you know  make this this country better you know  this is our home  those fasting came here from across the  US and stayed in this Washington church  Monica's parents also paid a visit to  support their daughter she didn't decide  to come we brought her like all these  kids here they wanted to see her mother  or her father but they didn't know what  they were doing I came because of  poverty I worked in Mexico from 6 a.m.  to 6 p.m. for 100 pesos I wasn't able to  afford anything I wanted my kids to  study and have a good profession use ish  ins also turned out to spur on the  dreamers in their week-long fast they  played a kind of music called cumbia the  Latin rhythm is known for its different  influences from diverse cultures  diversity a mixture that also  characterizes the dreamers  [Music]

